vendor/ffcs-union.json is built from two sources:

  1. vendor/ffcs-site.json
     The dataset the live site (ffcs.codechefvit.com) actually serves, extracted
     from its page bundle on 2026-10-28. It is older than the repository and
     still contains courses the repo deleted (e.g. BITE302L Database Systems).

  2. CodeChefVIT/ffcs at origin/prod (69aaf95), which already includes PRs
     293/296/297/298, exported from src/data.

Every course and offering from both sources is kept; duplicates are removed by
faculty + venue + slot. Nothing from either source can disappear.

Rebuild:
  npx tsx scripts/build-union.ts vendor/ffcs-site.json <prod/src/data>
  npm run catalog:import

The repository is MIT. Course offerings are factual allocation data.
